#AREA Pern~
#AUTHORS Jaxom  ~


#HELPS
1 PERN~
Pern is a world created by Anne McCaffrey where dragon riders roam the
skies defending against an ancient enemy, Thread.  This area has been
created using the ideas put forth in the Dragonriders of Pern series.
It has two quests, one for a jewelled dagger which is level 60, and
the other for dragonrider equipment at level 50.  F'lar is a good
person to talk to about the the approaching danger and it is rumored
that there is a secret passage in the lower caverns.  The Harpers of
Pern are known to wear some fancy damage clothes at level 70.

     (a) {150}Jaxom{100}

Last updated January 4th, 1999
{a}JAXOM
~
0 $~


#RANGES 50 75 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG
#MOBILES
#5600
green dragon~
a Green Dragon~
A green dragon stands before you.~
Although smaller than other dragons, she is still much bigger than you!~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE AFF_DETECT_INVIS 100 S
65 BODY_CLAW BODY_HEAD|BODY_CLAW 10D10+2200 2D10+33
50000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_RESTING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 0~
if class($n) == 6
 if iskiller($n) == 1
  if quest(30, 1, $n) == 0
    shout I have banished a filthy assassin!
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
  else
    mptransfer $n 2899
    mpat $n mpforce $n say I am a loser!
    shout I have sent a backstabbing assassin to hell!
  endif
 endif
endif
~
