~
>speech_prog history story~
if quest(8, 3, $n) == 3
  say You want me to tell you how I became weyrleader?
  say Very Well, Have a seat.
  mpmset self quest 0 3 1
endif
~
>rand_prog 40~
if quest(8, 3, $r) == 3
  if quest(0, 3, self) == 1
    say I grew up in Ruatha hold as the daugher of a holder.
    say until that tyrant Fax captured Ruatha by his
    say treachery.
    mpecho Lessa looks angry as she remembers what happened
    mpmset self quest 0 3 2
  else
    if quest(0, 3, self) == 2
      say I lived as a kitchen drudge awaiting my chance for 
      say revenge, until F'lar came on a search for the rider
      say of Benden's next queen.
      mpecho Lessa's face brightens and she is silent for a moment.
      mpmset self quest 0 3 3
    else
      if quest(0, 3, self) == 3
        say When the newly hatched queen chose me, I became the
        say Weyrwoman.  And Ramoth and I have been together ever
        say since.
        smile
        mpmset self quest 0 3 0
        mpmset $r quest 12 1 1
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p There is a Lord of Ruatha.~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 3
  frown
  say It will be as F'lar says.  I will relinquish my claim in 
  say favor of his stronger one.  You have been a great help in a 
  say time of need.  Go see Fandarel.
  say He will reward you for your services.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 4
endif
~
