#5612
f'lar flar weyrleader~
F'lar~
The Weyrleader stands here.~
He looks tall and lean, with a presence that you note immediately.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART AFF_DETECT_INVIS 0 S
95 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10D10+9000 2D10+80
1000000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog history story~
if quest(8, 3, $n) == 3
  say You want me to tell you how I became weyrleader?
  say Very Well, Have a seat.
  mpmset self quest 0 3 1
endif
~
>rand_prog 40~
if quest(8, 3, $r) == 3
  if quest(0, 3, self) == 1
    say I grew up in this weyr as the son of a weyrleader.
    say This did not give me any natural position so I was
    say treated just as any other fosterling.  Manora was
    say my foster mother.
    mpecho F'lar sighs as he remembers times before the current pass.
    mpmset self quest 0 3 2
  else
    if quest(0, 3, self) == 2
      say A weyrleader is chosen because it is his dragon that
      say flies the Queen.  I was lucky when I managed to impress
      say my bronze dragon as they are the largest of the males.
      mpecho F'lar pauses again with a smile on his face.
      mpmset self quest 0 3 3
    else
      if quest(0, 3, self) == 3
        say When the old queen died, a new queen was chosen and upon
        say maturity she had her first mating flight.  I was lucky
        say enough that my bronze won the chase.  So that is how I
        say became the Weyrleader.
        smile
        mpmset self quest 0 3 0
        mpmset $r quest 11 1 1
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p red star~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
  say This is very grave news.
  say Will you do something for me?  In this time of troubles, we 
  say need to have absolute cooperation from all the Lord Holders.  
  say The tyrant Fax is withholding his support.  Go tell Fax that I, 
  say F'lar sent you, and return to me with his reply.
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 1
endif
~
>greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 0
say I understand that you have information for me?
say What do you have to tell me?
else
  if quest(0, 3, $n) == 2
    say I understand that Fax gave you some trouble?
    say What did he say as he died?
  else
  endif
endif
if quest(4, 4, $n) == 5
   say I hear you have raised a fine dragon, $n.  I think yo
   say are ready to join a fighting wing as a dragonrider.
   say Go see manora and she will outfit you with what you need.
   mpmset $n quest 4 4 8
else
  if quest(4, 4, $n) == 11
     say I hear you have raised a fine dragon, $n.  I think you 
     say are ready to join a wing as a dragonrider.
     say Go see manora and she will outfit you with what you need.
     mpmset $n quest 4 4 8
  else
  endif
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 0~
if class($n) == 6
  if quest(30, 1, $n) == 0
    shout I have banished a filthy assassin!
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
  else
    mptransfer $n 2899
    mpat $n mpforce $n say I am a loser!
    shout I have sent a backstabbing assassin to hell!
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p I die, but at least I have taken Ruatha with me!~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 2
  say Hah!  He does not know that there is an heir!
  say His son, which he thought died at birth, survived.  Lessa is 
  say no longer the heir to Ruatha.  Fax's son will take that position
  say Go tell Lessa, 'There is a Lord of Ruatha.'
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 3
endif
~
