#5613
fax lord holder~
Fax~
The Lord Holder Fax stands here.~
He looks short and muscular, with an evil gleam in his eye.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART AFF_DETECT_INVIS -500 S
80 BODY_HAND BODY_FOOT 10D10+5000 2D10+70
1000000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
say Welcome to my hold!  Ruatha hold that is, for I have taken
say over many holds.  
wicked
say And they say that you can only rule one hold!
say I've shown them otherwise!
~
>all_greet_prog 0~
if class($n) == 6
  if quest(30, 1, $n) == 0
    shout I have banished a filthy assassin!
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
  else
    mptransfer $n 2899
    mpat $n mpforce $n say I am a loser!
    shout I have sent a backstabbing assassin to hell!
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog history story~
if quest(8, 3, $n) == 4
  say You want me to tell you about the holds?
  say Very Well, Have a seat.
  mpmset self quest 0 3 1
endif
~
>rand_prog 40~
if quest(8, 3, $r) == 4
  if quest(0, 3, self) == 1
    say A Lord Holder is born to his position and grows
    say to manhood knowing he will rule this land some day.
    say Most holders only ever rule one hold.
    mpecho Fax chuckles wickedly.
    mpmset self quest 0 3 2
  else
    if quest(0, 3, self) == 2
      say I however rule many holds.  This hold, Ruatha, I have
      say most recently conquered and now rule as my own.  Maybe
      say one day I will rule all of Pern!
      mpecho Fax laughs as he becomes lost in his fantasy world.
      mpmset self quest 0 3 0
      mpmset $r quest 8 3 5
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog F'lar~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 1
  say Here is what I think of that Weyrleader!
  mpecho Fax draws his dagger and attacks!
  mpkill $n
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 1
  say 'I die, but at least I have taken Ruatha with me!'
  mpmset $n quest 0 3 2
endif
~
