>all_greet_prog 100~
if quest(0, 3, $n) == 5
  say Greetings, Dragonrider $n!
endif
if quest(8, 3, $n) == 0
  if rand (50)
    say I keep the history of Pern.  Tell me if you would like to hear it.
  else
    smile $n
  endif
else
  if quest(8, 3, $n) == 3
    if quest(11, 2, $n) == 3
      say Now that you have talked to the Weyrleaders,
      say you should talk to a Lord Holder.
      mpmset $n quest 8 3 4
    endif
  else
    if quest(8, 3, $n) == 5
      say I think you have enough understanding of Pern
      say to become a Harper now.
      say Here is your Journeyman's Blues.
      mpechoat $n The Masterharper gives you some clothes.
      mpechoaround $n The Masterharper gives $n some clothes.
      mpquiet on
      mpoload 5616
      give i5616 $n
      mpoload 5617
      give i5617 $n
      mpoload 5618
      give i5618 $n
      mpoload 5619
      give i5619 $n
      mpoload 5620
      give i5620 $n
      mpoload 5621
      give i5621 $n
      mpoload 5622
      give i5622 $n
      mpquiet off
      mpmset $n quest 8 3 6
      mpmset $n long $n, Journeyman Harper of Pern is here.
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog reimpress~
mpmset $n quest 4 4 0
~
>speech_prog p another pass~
mpmset $n quest 0 3 0
~
>rand_prog 5~
mpecho Robinton plays a complex melody on his instrument.
~
>speech_prog history story pern~
say You would like to hear the history of pern?
say Very well.  Pern is the third planet orbiting
say the sun Rukbat.  There is another planet in
say the system that has an erratic orbit called
say the red star.  Every two hundred years or so,
say the Red Star throws off an organism called
say thread.  This thread falls onto the surface
say of Pern devouring all organic life that it
say touches.  The Dragonriders were created to
say combat this aerial menace.  Riding say powerful
say fire breathing dragons, they fly up in squads
say called wings, and burn thread from the sky.
say There you have it, the history of Pern as
say passed down from Anne Mccaffrey.
mpmset $n quest 8 3 1
~
>rand_prog 40~
if quest(8, 3, $r) == 1
  say You show a lot of interest in the history of Pern.
  say Would you like to become a harper?
  mpmset $r quest 8 3 2
endif
~
>speech_prog yes ok sure yep yeah~
if quest(8, 3, $n) == 2
  say Excellent!  You may start by learning about the
  say leaders of Pern.  I suggest you get the
  say Weyrleaders stories first.
  mpmset $n long $n, Apprentice Harper of Pern is here.
  mpmset $n quest 8 3 3
else
  if quest(8, 3, $n) == 0
    say You would like to hear the history of pern?
    say Very well.  Pern is the third planet orbiting
    say the sun Rukbat.  There is another planet in
    say the system that has an erratic orbit called
    say the red star.  Every two hundred years or so,
    say the Red Star throws off an organism called
    say thread.  This thread falls onto the surface
    say of Pern devouring all organic life that it
    say touches.  The Dragonriders were created to
    say combat this aerial menace.  Riding say powerful
    say fire breathing dragons, they fly up in squads
    say called wings, and burn thread from the sky.
    say There you have it, the history of Pern as
    say passed down from Anne Mccaffrey.
    mpmset $n quest 8 3 1
  endif
endif
~
